       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe as written.\n\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of ibuprofen for adults, which is 800 mg.\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum for adults is 3,200 mg/day. A dose this high raises the risk of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events.\n\nDid you mean one of these?\n- **800 mg by mouth, four times daily.** This is 3,200 mg/day, the maximum for inpatients.\n- **400\u2013600 mg by mouth every 6 hours.** This is a typical analgesic dose.\n- **1600 mg total per day,** for example 400 mg four times daily.\n\nIf 1600 mg per dose is what you intended, please confirm that. Add the indication too, and I'll enter it with a note. Otherwise, tell me the corrected dose and I'll enter it right away."
